@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 90

actor Guest
actor "Parent\n(incl. primary guardian)" as Parent
actor Specialist
actor Admin

rectangle "SEN Support Platform" as Platform
database "PostgreSQL\n(candidate relational DB)\nrecords and audit log" as Database
cloud "Email delivery service\n(optional; future, not in MVP)" as Email

Guest      -down-> Platform : browse public pages,\nregister / sign in
Parent     -down-> Platform : manage child profile,\nsessions and diary;\nview access events;\nexport / delete data\n(primary guardian)
Specialist -down-> Platform : view assigned child profile;\nsessions and diary\n(shared + specialists-only)
Admin      -down-> Platform : manage accounts and\nassignments; system audit log;\nmetadata only, no diary content

Platform -down-> Database : read and persist records,\nappend-only audit events
Platform .down.> Email    : future account\nnotifications

Guest      -[hidden]right- Parent
Parent     -[hidden]right- Specialist
Specialist -[hidden]right- Admin
Database   -[hidden]right- Email
@enduml